# Deploy and integrations

## Hosting

- Render: `render.yaml`, `scripts/render_start.sh`, `build.sh`, `Procfile` (Gunicorn). Health check: `/healthz/`.
- Do not change production env vars or trigger deploys without explicit user approval.

## Verification scripts

After deploy-related changes, document or run locally when applicable:

```bash
./scripts/render_smoke.sh
./scripts/production_url_audit.sh
```

## n8n and Google Drive

- Workflow export: `docs/hackathon/n8n/nexus-blood-report-agent.json` — keep in sync with webhook/callback URLs documented in README.
- Upload flow triggers n8n; callbacks update report AI fields — preserve idempotency and auth on callback endpoints when modifying views.

## Demo data

- Seeding via management commands under `app/management/commands/`; production seeding is gated (`SEED_DEMO_USERS`, showcase commands). Never run destructive seed/populate against non-local DBs without approval.
